column25:
Perfect World Cup/Royals/Chiefs game day stay just 10 minutes from Arrowhead Stadium in a quiet and safe neighborhood. 

There is a private pond at the end of the street to the east you are welcome to walk around and fish in. There is also a grill and table next to the pond you can use. Please help keep that area clean if you go over there!

Places to check out in Raytown:
